  "prefLabel": "Spe 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement. The following licenses shall be subject to reinstatement by the board:\n\n(a) Licenses suspended for disciplinary reasons as part of a settlement pursuant to Ahp 214 or as part of an order of the board; and\n\n(b) Licenses lapsed pursuant to Spe 402.02(b).\n\nSource. #9406, eff 3-7-09; ss by #9883-A, eff 3-5-11; ss by #11178, eff 9-17-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/spe100-600.html"
